✅ Experiment 2: Shodan-based Recon + Nmap NSE

Tools: Shodan CLI, Nmap, Kali Linux

Step 1: Locate GPS/Boat Systems (Shodan)

shodan search "AIS GPS"  # AIS used in ships
shodan search "port:80 title:Boat"

Step 2: Identify Internet-connected Cameras

shodan search "webcamXP"
shodan search "port:554 has_screenshot:true"

Step 3: Nmap NSE Script

Scan one IP found on Shodan:

nmap -sV --script http-title -p 80 198.51.100.10

Create and execute a basic NSE script:

-- myscript.nse
description = [[Simple HTTP Title Grabber]]
author = "Student"
categories = {"discovery"}

portrule = shortport.http

action = function(host, port)
  return "Scanning " .. host.ip
end

Run it:

nmap --script ./myscript.nse 198.51.100.10


